e,"text":"主人公とは同学年だが、主人公のことを “先輩” と呼び慕う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちと同じく一般庶民代表 （むしろ貧乏） なのだが、本人の意志と関係なくこの学園に通わされている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"授業中に造花の内職をしたり、百均で買った服をうれしそうに見せたりと健気で明るい後輩（実際は同級生）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性に触れられると、ぴょんぴょん飛び跳ねるアレルギー？の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性との会話も不可能。 脳内小説なら可（※本人談）。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あ、そうなんですか。 えへへ、ちょっとうれしいかも…」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22292"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9a/9a92362a20c1833bd4e440364784e122f7343517e28f7cca9881a52f7751bd77.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f47c64384684996fb9515fa40d23d5ce53efe694e5a1df77b7abae5ff27fb42.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"夏野 こおり","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:56901","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21121","characterName":"鮎川 寧々","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22293","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"78636"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2023"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21121"},"originalCharacterName":"鮎川 寧々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"70"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"142"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"71"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"52"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物理担当。２５才。彼氏いない暦２５年。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根拠ない自信の持ち主。割と頼りになる性格。演劇部の顧問。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼稚園から大学まで女子校、更に女子校の先生になった筋金入りの箱入り娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最後に男性に触れたのは小学校（の担任）とのフォークダンス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ええ、２５才ですよ。どこか変ですか？　なにか不審なところでも？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"2023","sourceWorkId":"19338","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"物理の担当教師で演劇部顧問。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼稚園から大学まで女子校に通い、さらに卒業後は女子校の先生になった筋金入りの箱入り娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最後に男性に触れたのは、小学校で担任と踊ったフォークダンス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"25才独身。もちろん彼氏いない暦も同じ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師になってからはさらに男性との接点も減っている。 でもいつも勝負下着に身を包む努力家？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ええ、25才ですよ。 どこか変ですか？　なにか不審なところでも？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"22293"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/71b90421126fcde3da2de2cb0c4de7b55a3de4ddd5e270dfb51c007aebf1a1b4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4002960be79345292f0d18a9ea9231e312b65c11945ae5b2ca0a6628d9c645d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"みる","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:56904","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21122","characterName":"姫乃宮 鉄男","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"22294","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"78636"}],"egsCharacterIds":["2024"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21122"},"originalCharacterName":"姫乃宮 鉄男","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"２年生。明るく元気でノリの良い性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"トニックシャンプーと深夜アニメを愛する、色んな意味で男らしい男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"チャームポイントは、骨太な骨格と肩幅"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひょんなことから有名女子校に通うことになったが、間